gical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Sunscale.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Sunscale.png/420px-Legendary_Sunscale.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"702\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Sunscale.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This impressive suit of armor seems to fill you with hope and banish all doubt.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221051\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.103 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.197 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4167/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33390/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11026/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n130.82%  230.741     59 Template:IO\n100.00%  176.386      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  176.386      1 -total\n 98.41%  173.587      1 Templat